WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.317 --> 00:00:01.720
- [Narrator] This story starts in Hungary,

00:00:01.720 --> 00:00:04.259
land of hot baths, daredevil horsemen

00:00:04.259 --> 00:00:06.842
and some very funky sweet wine.

00:00:13.315 --> 00:00:15.633
This guy, loves rocks.

00:00:15.633 --> 00:00:17.493
He has over 21 different types.

00:00:17.493 --> 00:00:18.771
He believes these volcanic rocks

00:00:18.771 --> 00:00:22.938
are what makes his wine
taste the best in the world.

00:00:28.911 --> 00:00:32.474
Tokaji is known as Hungary's
world famous sweet wine country.

00:00:32.474 --> 00:00:34.655
It produces wine so
famous that it was dubbed,

00:00:34.655 --> 00:00:37.810
King of Wines by none
other than King Louis XV.

00:00:37.810 --> 00:00:40.306
- [Man] Hmm, delicious.

00:00:40.306 --> 00:00:41.944
- [Narrator] Istvan's
family has been making

00:00:41.944 --> 00:00:43.981
sweet wines in the region since the 1500s,

00:00:43.981 --> 00:00:47.731
making him the 16th
generation in his family.

00:01:02.371 --> 00:01:05.392
And this is where Istvan's rocks come in.

00:01:05.392 --> 00:01:07.632
His vineyards are on top of over 30 layers

00:01:07.632 --> 00:01:10.571
of mineral rich soils created
by ancient volcanic activity,

00:01:10.571 --> 00:01:14.875
making them perfect for
big fat grapes like these.

00:01:14.875 --> 00:01:18.209
So there's these rocks and
then there's the rotten part.

00:01:18.209 --> 00:01:20.374
You see, there's a secret
to making sweet wine.

00:01:20.374 --> 00:01:24.651
Those big juicy grapes
need to contain fungus

00:01:24.651 --> 00:01:28.038
called, Botrytis, otherwise
known as Noble Rot.

00:01:28.038 --> 00:01:29.834
Once the grapes are
infected with Botrytis,

00:01:29.834 --> 00:01:34.001
they shrivel up and turn
dry, making them extra sweet.

00:01:42.769 --> 00:01:45.367
After the harvest, the
infected grapes are pressed

00:01:45.367 --> 00:01:47.216
and fermented in wooden barrels.

00:01:47.216 --> 00:01:49.431
What comes out is a glass of sweet wine,

00:01:49.431 --> 00:01:51.670
well, fit for a king.

00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:52.837
- [Man] Merci.

00:02:07.859 --> 00:02:12.026
- [Narrator] To rocks and
fungus and sweet wine, cheers.

